  "name": "Baiyoke Suite Hotel",
  "starRating": 3,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RXLContentId",
      "text": "27951"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "With a stay at Baiyoke Suite Hotel, you\u0027ll be centrally located in Bangkok, within a 10-minute walk of Baiyoke Tower II and Pratunam Market.  This hotel is 0.8 mi (1.2 km) from Platinum Fashion Mall and 0.9 mi (1.5 km) from CentralWorld Shopping Complex."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 236 air-conditioned rooms featuring refrigerators and minibars. Complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected, and cable programming is available for your entertainment. Private bathrooms with shower/tub combinations feature complimentary toiletries and hair dryers. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Take advantage of recreation opportunities including a sauna and a fitness center. This hotel also features complimentary wireless internet access, shopping on site, and tour/ticket assistance."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EBaiyoke Tower II - 0.4 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Pratunam Market - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Platinum Fashion Mall - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Central Chidlom Department Store - 1.2 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Erawan Shrine - 1.4 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E CentralWorld Shopping Complex - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Central Embassy - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Victory Monument - 1.7 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Siam Square - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Siam Paragon Mall - 2 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Chulalongkorn University - 2 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Siam Center - 2.1 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Nana Square - 2.2 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Bumrungrad Hospital - 2.2 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Jim Thompson House Museum - 2.4 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EDon Mueang Intl. Airport (DMK) - 22.4 km / 13.9 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Suvarnabhumi Intl. Airport (BKK) - 29.5 km / 18.3 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Baiyoke Suite Hotel is Suvarnabhumi Intl. Airport (BKK). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards, debit cards, and cash\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a security system\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPlease note that cultural norms and guest policies may differ by country and by property; the policies listed are provided by the property\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EAdditional fees apply to children 4-12 years old for breakfast when sharing existing bedding.\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E   \u003Cli\u003EOne child 12 years old or younger stays free when occupying the parent or guardian\u0027s room, using existing bedding. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENo pets and no service animals are allowed at this property. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EParking height restrictions apply. \u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "For lunch or dinner, stop by Sky Lounge, a restaurant that specializes in international cuisine. Dining is also available at the coffee shop/cafe, and room service (during limited hours) is provided. Wrap up your day with a drink at the bar/lounge. Buffet breakfasts are available daily from 6:30 AM to 9 AM for a fee."
    }
  ],
